+1. **`gateway/platforms/webhook.py`** — Add `"newplat"` to the delivery type tuple
+2. **`cron/scheduler.py`** — Add to `_KNOWN_DELIVERY_PLATFORMS` frozenset and `_deliver_result()` platform map
